Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.74,0:01:23.33,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}プレ！　プレパラート！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:26.33,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}強くなんかないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.71,0:01:29.46,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}プレ！　プレパレード！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:32.13,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}いつか君を捕まえる！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.39,0:01:50.15,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}油断したら　その指　チクチクアタック　覚悟して
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:56.11,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}小さいけど　挟むの　ミジンコみたいなアナタ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.57,0:02:00.53,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}欲しいのは　プラスチックなハート
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.57,0:02:02.53,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fs-2\fad(150,150)\pos(640,670)}プラス　プラス　ダケドマイナス
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:09.92,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}でもそれじゃつまらない　そこに気付いた者勝ち
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.71,0:02:15.63,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H439AF4&}恋は甘くて　苦いもの
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.63,0:02:18.63,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H4FBBD3&}単純明快　複雑怪奇な代物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:21.59,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}どうでもいい事ばっかり気にしたりするの
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.64,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}どんな感じ？ソンな感じ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:27.64,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}温厚篤実　エキセントリックなアナタ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:30.65,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}強がる素振りを全身まとって太刀打ち
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:33.65,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}素直なだけだと刺激が強くて　クラクラ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:39.07,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}傷ついちゃうの　傷つけちゃうの　純情プレパラート
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:45.03,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H5E47F0&}頭の中は　いつも一人の　純情プレパレード
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.74,0:01:23.33,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Pre!  Praparat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:26.33,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}我完全就不堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.71,0:01:29.46,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Pre!  Pre-Parade!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:32.13,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}我終究會把你攬入懷裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.39,0:01:50.15,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}敢大意的話就做好覺悟  你的手指就會受到刺針般的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:56.11,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}雖然你像水蚤一樣小隻  不過還是能夾起來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.57,0:02:00.53,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}想要的  是那顆塑膠內心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.57,0:02:02.53,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fs-2\fad(150,150)\pos(640,55)}Plus Plus  卻還是Minus
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:09.92,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}只是那樣是百般無聊  發現這點的就是贏家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.71,0:02:15.63,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H439AF4&}戀愛是甜蜜中夾帶苦澀的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.63,0:02:18.63,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H4FBBD3&}是單純明快且複雜奇怪的玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:21.59,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}總會在意些無關重要的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.64,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}是什麼感覺？就是這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:27.64,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}溫厚老實且稀奇古怪的你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:30.65,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}硬要逞強不斷全力揮棒與我較量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:33.65,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}你說自己很坦率  這個太過刺激讓你頭暈眼花
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:39.07,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}快要受傷了  快要傷害你了  純情的Praparat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:45.03,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H5E47F0&}腦海中一直只有一個人  純情的Pre-Parade
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:59.79,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}バニラソルトで Burning Love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:07.38,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマいだけなら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.68,0:22:12.43,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ソルトかけましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:19.10,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}誰よりももっともっと私を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.10,0:22:22.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}知って欲しいからさらけだしたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.69,0:22:25.99,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}でも出来ないの　経験Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:27.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}モドカシすぎる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:34.66,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}でも、アマいだけの愛はちょっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:42.38,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}私が求めているモノとは違う
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.92,0:22:46.09,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}シロと言われたら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.38,0:22:49.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}クロだって言っちゃう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:52.89,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}素直になれない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.31,0:22:55.27,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマノジャク
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:22:59.81,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}スキと言われたら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.15,0:23:03.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ダイキライだって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:09.07,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}嬉しいのにナニ言ってんだろう?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.57,0:23:16.08,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマいバニラに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.24,0:23:21.08,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ソルトかけるよに…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:59.79,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}香草加點鹽  讓愛火燃燒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:07.38,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}如果只有甜味太過單調的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.68,0:22:12.43,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}就加一點鹽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:19.10,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}想讓你比起別人都能更加了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.10,0:22:22.69,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}所以想把自己的一切全盤展示出來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.69,0:22:25.99,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}但是我做不到  因為經驗是零
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:27.65,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}讓人看著心急
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:34.66,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}但是  甜蜜的愛情只有一點點
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:42.38,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}跟我追求的東西不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.92,0:22:46.09,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}如果你說是白色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.38,0:22:49.51,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我就會說是黑色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:52.89,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}無法變得坦率起來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.31,0:22:55.27,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}最喜歡鬧彆扭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:22:59.81,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你說喜歡我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.15,0:23:03.23,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我就會回覆最討厭你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:09.07,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明明內心很高興  我怎麼會說那些話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.57,0:23:16.08,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}在甜甜的香草上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.24,0:23:21.08,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}撒一點鹽吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:53.27,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(378,462)\pos(354,620)}泳池開放
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.02,0:23:35.03,Title,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H5C5C5C&\pos(918,523)}為誰而戰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我把真正的自己展示出來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,會喜歡我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  我…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  高須他們在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大河?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好像很糟糕?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,亞美選的時機太差了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,這是誤會…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好像沒人在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他們到底去哪裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要說謊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不想承認嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,除了你以外  竟然有其她女生出現在這裡房間裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,笨…你別說這種奇怪的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.03,0:01:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,別說但是  快說真話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我說真話?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭  高須真壞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:14.59,Comment,,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,大…大河
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.42,0:01:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  發生了什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事都沒有  如果是問我的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.26,0:03:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的晚餐是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,雜燴飯  這個你很喜歡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,吃紅豆飯不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧  醜鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,醜!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那個大河  傍晚那件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是川嶋在捉弄我而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.19,0:03:30.71,Comment,,0,0,0,,醜  醜  醜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且是…該怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.23,0:03:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好像讓你的心情變差了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要跟我道歉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,龍兒真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.31,0:03:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,小…小鸚!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,振作一點  小鸚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快清醒過來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:04:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  快起來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  沒時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我們睡過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,總之快點準備好去上學
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,早餐吃什麼  為什麼今天要這樣叫醒我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,早餐和便當都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不在5分鐘內出門  就會遲到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕  不去便利店的話就沒午飯吃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你有在聽嗎  大…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,聽到了  色狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要去便利店是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.39,0:04:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事  不就是飯而已也不用這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,趕上了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,總算來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天那樣幫我  真的非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是對我的夏季校服看入迷了?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,別擋路  笨蛋吉娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.26,0:05:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,原來你在啊  逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.69,0:05:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,早  川嶋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也是一大早就進入發情期  真是辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  你們兩個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,原來是這樣  真討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.49,0:05:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,別因為那點小事就吃醋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是你的誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你這女人也是什麼也不懂  昨天的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大家  早
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣鍛鍊  我的手臂說不定會變細
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨  別拿我來鍛鍊肌肉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  明天就是大家期待已久的泳池開放日
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我現在開始說明注意事項
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,說到夏天  就是夏日戀愛大冒險
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是步入30歲前最後的拚搏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.69,0:05:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,慘了  我的小肚子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯  我的大腿也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我的上臂更加糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.12,0:06:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你們在說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.79,0:06:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,光是年輕就很有資本了  混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,這個學校的游泳課要和男生一起上嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭  很難為情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼  你不是非常可愛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,再說還是模特啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,居然還說難為情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,說什麼呢  你說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,說什麼  你到底說什麼啊  混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:27.13,Comment,,0,0,0,,老師班會時間差不多到了  是時候結束了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好  結束!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,起立
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,大河來吧  快點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不要  我才不要買泳衣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,去年的壞掉了不能穿  也沒有辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.51,0:06:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,泳衣需要馬上洗好晾乾才行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.49,0:06:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而且為什麼連那傢伙也在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,因為只有這家店有賣泳衣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.17,0:06:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我邀請她的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.55,0:06:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,這件非常適合逢坂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.91,0:07:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,簡直是為她量身定做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.31,0:07:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,大河冷靜點  現在是公眾場合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,高須  你覺得這件怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,非常適合你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你們覺得這件怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不會很奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不會很顯眼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那對修長的腿是怎麼回事  你也太過顯眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.69,0:07:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,明明選了一件很樸素的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,川…川嶋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,這件泳衣是哪家公司做的  放在哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我們買一樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,只有這件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就放過我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.64,0:07:51.53,Comment,,0,0,0,,櫛枝…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:07:52.52,Comment,,0,0,0,,我說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,亞美是不是超超超級過分可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:07:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,太可怕了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:08:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是穿著這麼樸素的泳衣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.15,0:08:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,這份可愛  美麗還有身材
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.53,0:08:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,能到達什麼境界呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看來要將這些藏起來  幾乎是犯罪了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.51,0:08:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,高須也是這樣想的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.44,0:08:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.65,0:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧  大…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道如何是好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了  發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,無論如何都決定不了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.27,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你不喜歡什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.17,0:08:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,顏色只能選紺色和黑色
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不是顏色  是尺寸不對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那個  兒童尺寸怎麼樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,打死也不要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.91,0:08:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不要跟笨蛋吉娃娃說一樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這件不是相當小嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,價格也很合適
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,衣料也厚實
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.56,0:08:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也能放進乾燥機
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你有穿過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:08:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那件…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:08:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,穿過了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那一件還勉強湊合…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是該怎麼說  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那就買這一件吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  這也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  晚飯你想吃什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我會做你想吃的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,對了  明天游泳課的準備做好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.83,0:09:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,別忘記帶毛巾了  是要浴巾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我說你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,又在生什麼氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,泳衣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.43,0:09:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,該不會還在生昨晚那件事的氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.76,0:09:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那到底是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不會游泳  就因為這點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.13,0:09:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,能這麼輕鬆說出來  肯定不是真正的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,遲到  要遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.23,0:09:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:10:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,把這個喝了再走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝  小龍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.24,0:10:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好燙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,小龍特調的豆漿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,大豆含有的伊索諾渤渤什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.11,0:10:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說能讓胸部變大
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(663,658)}Isoflavone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是大豆異黃酮素
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果下垂的話就麻煩了  這是預付措施
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小泰真聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,大河H Sketch One Touch
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.01,0:10:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,別性騷擾人家老媽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.81,0:10:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  有夠吵鬧的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎麼了  感覺很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,豆子…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.18,0:10:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,難吃  不過我還要!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:10:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(728,658)}Isoflavone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:10:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想補充大豆異黃酮素啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,泳衣的尺寸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(663,658)}Isoflavone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,和大豆異黃酮素
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.57,0:11:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  難道你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不要  別說出來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,別再說下去!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你是貧乳嗎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  這種事需要那麼在意嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.37,0:11:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不就胸部小一點而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.86,0:11:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.19,0:11:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有弧度吧  是貧乳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.45,0:11:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,罩杯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,帶了  但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:11:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,還是撐不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以泳池什麼的  我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,總之穿點什麼吧  會感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.27,0:12:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看了那個你能理解我的悲傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:25.64,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准圆_GBK\bord0\c&H42341F&\frz284.4\move(303,-4,303,314)}悲哀的胸部
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:26.93,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准圆_GBK\bord0\c&H42341F&\frz284.4\pos(303,316)}悲哀的胸部
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好過分
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,悲哀的胸部…居然說我悲哀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.99,0:12:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我是貧乳  所以被同情了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.55,0:12:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不  這只是寫這些字的人的感想而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我也當然血洗了流出照片的攝影社
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,話說  攝影社還真是毫無預兆地就毀滅了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,明明不能在北村面前暴露這種悲哀的身材
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,人家不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.58,0:12:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  大河
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了  我來想辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,為了讓你能挺起胸膛出現在北村面前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我來想辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事  你回去睡覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我在這裡等你做好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.23,0:13:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在龍兒做好之前  我都會醒著
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺  總感覺…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:13:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我賭氣  弄得像吵架一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:13:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我出嫁的時候一定會帶上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,丸尾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,丸尾不帶眼鏡更帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.25,0:14:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,換隱形眼鏡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一定沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我也沒帶眼鏡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:40.74,Comment,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:41.62,Comment,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再見了  逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.13,0:14:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,快點  我幫你紮頭髮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.30,0:14:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:14:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,麻耶  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,頭髮很難紮好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.45,0:15:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,亞美
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是模特
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,身材真好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,該怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常感動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.07,0:15:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是女神
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:18.93,Comment,,0,0,0,,果然跟我們是不同的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不是當然的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的亞美也很可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,愚民來吧  允許你們對天使的降臨跪地膜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.27,0:15:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,來  舔我的影子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,這對你們來說是最棒的美食吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  別笑話我了  麻耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,高須
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨  別亂跑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,髮型又會變亂的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好  就這樣做熱身運動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.99,0:15:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就這樣跑步…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,這只是假動作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,只要進入泳池  別人就看不到這個小肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.26,0:16:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就去游泳了  再會
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.39,0:16:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂  你終於出來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,該不會是泳衣太過鬆垮不成人樣  所以不敢出來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼  夢話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你在睡覺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要是被曬傷就不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.62,0:16:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,僅僅一年時間  居然成長到這種程度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.62,0:16:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我果然是老虎派
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼啊  非常普通
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不過身材比例還是那麼差
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,偽乳☆特戰隊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,穿幫了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是實乃梨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.62,0:16:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.62,0:16:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你是逢坂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒戴眼鏡  看不是很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.95,0:16:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,這個尺寸是逢坂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:16:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要躲起來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那個髮型像老鼠一樣挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一…一邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是說錯話了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.07,0:17:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.39,0:17:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那個  讓我看看手臂的肌肉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好壯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就只管自己…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,受歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我們對格差社會提出疑問
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是夏天的後背摔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,丸尾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:42.04,Comment,,0,0,0,,你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要動手嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然是一如既往的自由課程
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣很危險吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.14,0:17:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧  大…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,北村說我的髮型可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.45,0:18:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不  雖然有說好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.83,0:18:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,發現獵物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.85,0:18:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我們上吧  壘球社同盟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  下一個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.89,0:18:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是  老大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,活該  被人丟出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯  很開心呢  逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,這是戲玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不能真的發脾氣哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看我的!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  下手也太重了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭  只是戲玩而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  大河沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,大河?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不會游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.41,0:18:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不會游泳嗎!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.92,0:18:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  別衝動
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.05,0:18:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大河!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,老師!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不行!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.55,0:19:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,冷靜一點  大河
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.93,0:19:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,胸墊掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.22,0:19:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一邊掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那個很糟糕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.95,0:19:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,大河!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.16,0:19:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不能過來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.15,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡  既然這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.84,0:19:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,恥辱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.15,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不說對不起嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道你不會游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.14,0:20:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,別這樣  大家都回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,消消氣…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.87,0:20:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不是一句對不起能解決的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,都怪你做了那麼無聊的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胸…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.15,0:20:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,胸被…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,總之!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.77,0:20:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,給我道歉  給我道歉  給我道歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不過話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.29,0:20:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂不會游泳的話  就不能一起去海邊和泳池了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,高須
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.55,0:20:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我家的別墅就在海邊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的話  我們一起過暑假吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  你現在不是跟大河道歉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.45,0:20:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的話  祐作也一起去就可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.67,0:20:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了  逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.03,0:20:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你再繼續肆意妄為的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.86,0:21:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把前陣子的模仿秀100連發影片流出市面
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不對  是150來著
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣做的話  我會控告你侵害肖像權
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是掌中老虎  也無法逃脫法律的制裁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,拳頭會受傷的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但是但是實乃梨  逢坂對我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,都是這隻笨蛋吉娃娃的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.68,0:21:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,說到底就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.66,0:21:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.51,0:21:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,想用拳頭建立友情的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.97,0:21:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就不是用打架
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.23,0:21:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就用運動來決勝負吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,運…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,運動?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.66,0:23:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,高須爭奪戰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.05,0:23:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,亞美炭VS老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.03,0:23:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼好事總是高須能遇到
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.22,0:23:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大家也來爭奪我  然後蹂躪我吧
